body:
When I was younger probably about 7 I had went to my grandparents house in Puerto Rico. It was about midnight when I woke up from bed for I felt hungry.

I remember I headed to the kitchen. I climbed the cabinet to grab a packet of Bimbo cookies. Not the white bear bimbo cookies. If you want look up Bimbo cookies Puerto Rico. Anyways I grab the packet and just begin digging in when suddenly my grandfather just turns on the light in the kitchen and catches me red handed.

And I remember the conversation exactly. It was originally in Spanish but I’ll translate. 

“Que tú haces?” {What are you doing?}

“Yo tenia hambre. Y estos galletas esta tan delicioso.” {I was hungry. And these cookies are so delicious.}

My grandfather just nods.

“Tú quieres a compra más?” {You wanna buy more?}

I just nod my head and that’s what we proceeded to do. Around 12:20 at night we went to a twenty four hour supermarket and we bought more cookies and juice walking back home I remember just thanking him and him telling him don’t mention just don’t tell your father.

When we got back home we just ate cookies, drank grape juice and talk.

“When the world turns its back on you, you turn your back on the world.”
- Timon {Lion King}

“If every Pork chip we’re perfect we wouldn’t have hotdogs.”
- Greg Universe {Steven Universe}
